	quest.5393BBF5196A12BF.quest_desc: [
		"Just Dire Things grows new metals from goo. You drop blocks on top of goo and wait: the goo slowly transforms them."
		""
		"§eThe path:§r four tiers of goo, each making a stronger metal. Each metal unlocks tools, machines and upgrades. It ends with portal guns, time wands and the Paradox Machine."
		""
		"Get a couple of iron blocks ready."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 2 x Block of Iron and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
